#: app/flights/crew_removal.py:109
#, python-format
msgid "One flight stays in a pilot's logbook as a flight on another aircraft; it was only removed from this aircraft's log."
msgid_plural "%(num)d flights stay in pilots' logbooks as flights on another aircraft; they were only removed from this aircraft's log."
